{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17146","headline":"试中和节诏赐公卿尺诗 · 陆复礼","name":"试中和节诏赐公卿尺诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春仲令初吉，欢娱乐大中。\n皇恩贞百度，宝尺赐羣公。\n欲使方隅法，还令规矩同。\n捧观珍质丽，拜受圣恩崇。\n如荷丘山重，思酬方寸功。\n从兹度天地，与国庆无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆复礼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}